From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Volodymyr Pavlenko <volodymyr.pavlenko@mind.be>
Date: Thu, 28 May 2026 16:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] UPSTREAM:PROTOCOL:hostapd:wpa_supplicant: Emit Multi-AP assoc response event

The Multi-AP profile and primary VLAN ID are parsed from the association
response before the WPA 4-way handshake starts, but these values were only
reported later in CTRL-EVENT-CONNECTED. That event is emitted after the
connection reaches WPA_COMPLETED, so it is too late for upper layers that need
to configure the backhaul STA VLAN path before tagged EAPOL is exchanged.

Emit a dedicated CTRL-EVENT-ASSOC-RESP message as soon as the association
response Multi-AP IE has been parsed. This lets pWHM learn the primary VLAN ID
before the connected event.

Patch-dependency: z011-Multi-AP-Add-wpa-supp.patch

Signed-off-by: Volodymyr Pavlenko <volodymyr.pavlenko@mind.be>
---
 src/common/wpa_ctrl.h   | 2 ++
 wpa_supplicant/events.c | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/common/wpa_ctrl.h b/src/common/wpa_ctrl.h
index 5ff02dc..06e7b4b 100644
--- a/src/common/wpa_ctrl.h
+++ b/src/common/wpa_ctrl.h
@@ -26,0 +27,2 @@ extern "C" {
+/** Association response parsed during connection attempt */
+#define WPA_EVENT_ASSOC_RESP "CTRL-EVENT-ASSOC-RESP "
diff --git a/wpa_supplicant/events.c b/wpa_supplicant/events.c
index aa5954e..837c7ac 100644
--- a/wpa_supplicant/events.c
+++ b/wpa_supplicant/events.c
@@ -3121,0 +3122,6 @@ static void multi_ap_process_assoc_resp(struct wpa_supplicant *wpa_s,
+	wpa_msg(wpa_s, MSG_INFO,
+		WPA_EVENT_ASSOC_RESP "multi_ap_profile=%u"
+		" multi_ap_primary_vlanid=%u",
+		(unsigned int) wpa_s->multi_ap_profile,
+		(unsigned int) wpa_s->multi_ap_primary_vlanid);
+
